      "content": "i already changed my passwords and updated everything but it's still happening. the timing is just so specific. the lights turn amber right when i'm about to fall asleep, almost like someone is watching me or trying to mess with my mood. my ex used to be obsessed with that specific light setting. do u think it's possible they found a backdoor or a way to bypass my new password? how can i tell if the changes are coming from my account or from some kind of external hack?",
